      "writtenOn": "2022-05-05T07:51:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) I agree. I\u0027ll also extend unit tests for this case.\n2) Yeap, but I guess we could clear the sticky flag if all devices from the group got disconnected.\n3) I wasn\u0027t sure about it TBH, but I\u0027ve changed that in the latest revision. I\u0027ll revert this change then.\n4) I might be wrong but I see no reason why more than 1 couldn\u0027t be added. I\u0027ll add a counter. Clearing the counter at whole group disconnection seems reasonable.",
      "parentUuid": "96aff3e1_fb2ffa67",
